![Blog Hero Banner - AeraHUB 25, Why Attend in Person (1)](//images.ctfassets.net/mh1amgo8m7ts/1hy1GhRIXbPiDbVMDw9DFG/76b2cdb05a0ef344407f9bd8a9ec7c0f/Blog_Hero_Banner_-_AeraHUB_25__Why_Attend_in_Person__1_.jpg)

<p>The countdown is on for our flagship global event in New York City — <a href="https://www.aeratechnology.com/aerahub-2025" target="_blank">AeraHUB 25, the Decision Intelligence Global Summit</a> — and the excitement is building fast!
</p>

Registrations are coming in from around the world, and with so much momentum, we’re expanding the agenda to make this year’s experience even more dynamic than ever before.

<p>While AeraHUB 25 will once again be offered in a hybrid format, there’s nothing quite like being on site at <a href="https://www.thetimescenter.com" target="_blank">The Times Center in New York City</a>. Here’s what awaits those joining us in person this November:</p>

<ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
  <li>
    <strong>Connect directly with experts.</strong>  
    Meet Aera Technology’s decision intelligence specialists face to face. In person, you’ll have the chance to ask questions, get deeper insights, and learn directly from the people who are shaping the future of Aera, the decision intelligence agent.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>See live demos in action.</strong>  
    Our most exciting innovations come to life on stage. From the latest packaged skills to platform advancements, you’ll see firsthand how Aera is empowering enterprises to boost productivity, handle unstructured data, and run powerful what-if analyses with ease.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Advance your skills.</strong>  
    Join a live, interactive decision architect training session to deepen your expertise in building intelligent, scalable decision ecosystems. Learn how to break down complex decisions, design frameworks that capture real-world dynamics, apply change management strategies for adoption, and digitize decisions with Aera, the decision intelligence agent.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Engage with partners.</strong>  
    Get guidance from our ecosystem of partners on starting or scaling your decision intelligence journey. Discover real-world use cases across industries and walk away with proven strategies to apply within your own business.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Build your network.</strong>  
    Connect with peers, partners, and Aera experts throughout the day — from casual conversations over breakfast and lunch to a celebratory cocktail reception at The Times Center. The evening event promises meaningful dialogue, new connections, and a chance to reflect on the latest innovations over great food and drinks.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Experience the full impact.</strong>  
    Nothing compares to the energy of the main stage. You’ll hear directly from industry leaders, product innovators, and keynote speakers from IDC, Accenture, Hershey, Gallo, AstraZeneca, and of course Aera Technology’s CEO, Fred Laluyaux.
  </li>
</ul>

<p>Curious what the AeraHUB experience feels like? <a href="javascript:;" id="openPopup">Watch our sizzle reel from past events</a> and get a glimpse of the energy, insights, and connections that await in New York.</p>

__Experience it live this November__. Join us in New York for this premier gathering of innovators and practitioners in decision intelligence. See firsthand how applying AI to optimize and automate decision-making is reshaping industries and unlocking new opportunities for growth.

Be part of the momentum at AeraHUB 25 and experience the future of decision intelligence firsthand.

<div class="videoPopup" id="videoPopup">
                <div class="videoContainer">
                    <button class="closeBtn" id="closePopup">&times;</button>
                    <iframe id="vimeoVideo" src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1092832152?h=072b10d5bc&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                    <script src="https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js"></script>
                </div>
            </div>
<style>
  .videoPopup{
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .8);
    -ms-flex-pack: center;
    justify-content: center;
    -ms-flex-align: center;
    align-items: center;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .videoContainer{
    position: relative;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    width: 90%;
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  .videoContainer iframe{
    width: 100%;
    height: 315px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .closeBtn{
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    right: -10px;
    background: #3798d1;
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 18px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
  }
</style>
<script>
  const openPopup = document.getElementById("openPopup");
  const closePopup = document.getElementById("closePopup");
  const videoPopup = document.getElementById("videoPopup");
  openPopup.addEventListener("click", () => {
            document.getElementById("videoPopup").style.display = "flex";
            document.getElementById("vimeoVideo").src += "&autoplay=1";
        });
        closePopup.addEventListener("click", () => {
            document.getElementById("videoPopup").style.display = "none";
            document.getElementById("vimeoVideo").src = document.getElementById("vimeoVideo").src.replace("&autoplay=1", "");
        });
        videoPopup.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
            if (e.target === videoPopup) {
                document.getElementById("videoPopup").style.display = "none";
                document.getElementById("vimeoVideo").src = document.getElementById("vimeoVideo").src.replace("&autoplay=1", "");
            }
        });
</script>
